# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) if you need overrides.
# No Slack bot/user tokens required — Approve writes a durable outbox;
# Grok posts via Slack MCP and acks the outbox item.
# No GitHub tokens — watcher/agent POSTs canonical events; Control never calls GitHub.

# Optional overrides (defaults are the Control E2E harness):
# SLACK_E2E_CHANNEL_ID=C0BVCSA4T2P
# SLACK_E2E_THREAD_TS=1788808933.776429

# V0.7 chip 3 — Review runner invoke hook (NOT a skill).
# Live default is UNSET → Agent Failed/Blocked "No review backend" (no invented findings).
# fake = CI/smoke/Demo QA only — do NOT use as Live default.
# CONTROL_REVIEW_BACKEND=claude-cli
# CONTROL_REVIEW_BACKEND=cursor-cloud
# CONTROL_REVIEW_BACKEND=fake
# CONTROL_REVIEW_BACKEND=command
# CONTROL_REVIEW_COMMAND=my-pr-review --in {{in}} --out {{out}}
